ine-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E59700"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5C830">In recognition of your partnership with Qantas, and as a valued Qantas Business Rewards member, we would like to&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5B460">schedule a call</strong>&nbsp;with you and one of our team members who will provide an overview of the Program, the benefits available to your business and tips on how to get the most out of your membership. If you are interested in this, please reply with confirmation of your availability for a call and we will be in contact with you.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5C940"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5CB80">In the meantime, information about the benefits your business can access via our Program partners is available via our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-on-business-expenses.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5C4A0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">website</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5CC90"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5D5F0">For assistance with your account, please call our Service Centre on 13 74 78 between 7am-7pm AEST, Monday to Friday.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5D700"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5D940"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5B200">Qantas Business Rewards</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5BC90"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5BEF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E5CED0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000015E55200" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody